    <briefdescription>
<para>Computes covariances over a sliding window of recent samples. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This provider maintains a fixed-size window of samples and continuously updates the covariance estimate. Useful for adaptive covariance that responds to changing sensor noise characteristics. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
